Execute or Groth16-prove a canonical PFTL egress witness

Usage: pfusdc-tier4-prover egress [OPTIONS] --witness <WITNESS> --output-dir <OUTPUT_DIR>

Options:
      --elf <ELF>
          Frozen ELF for the selected verifier release. Default: embedded pfETH ELF
      --egress-release <EGRESS_RELEASE>
          Immutable program identity pinned by the destination verifier [default: pfeth-v1] [possible values: arc-v2, pfeth-v1]
      --witness <WITNESS>
          
      --output-dir <OUTPUT_DIR>
          
      --prove
          
  -h, --help
          Print help
